    {
      "id": "claim_653a208b547e4998bb0bf9e5e14e1911",
      "statement": "verify_facts, FactVerificationConfig, FactVerificationMetrics, ClaimVerification, SimpleClaimDecomposer, SpacyClaimDecomposer, ClaimDecomposer, and Claim are exported from the cite_right package and are available with the base install; only SpacyClaimDecomposer construction needs the [spacy] extra plus a downloaded spaCy model.",
